---
import { areas } from "../data/product.js";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="N-Ops — Open-source Infrastructure Control Plane"
  description="Manage servers, secrets, containers, jobs and audit from one open-source control plane. Self-host free under GNU GPL-V3.0, or use the managed service with enterprise SLAs."
  path="/"
>

<!-- ───────── HERO ───────── -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-[clamp(28px,5vw,64px)] max-bp3:pt-3" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <canvas id="heroField" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap relative">
    <div class="rgrid items-end mb-[clamp(10px,2vw,22px)] max-bp3:mb-0">
      <p class="eyebrow col-span-6 max-bp3:order-1"><span class="bar"></span>Open-source infrastructure control plane</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute right-0 -top-[2%] -bottom-[2%] w-[min(34%,500px)] pointer-events-none max-bp3:relative max-bp3:top-auto max-bp3:bottom-auto max-bp3:w-[min(80%,340px)] max-bp3:aspect-[1/.9] max-bp3:mt-2 max-bp3:mb-3 max-bp3:ml-auto" id="nSlot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h1 id="h1" class="relative pointer-events-none text-[clamp(3.4rem,8.4vw,8.2rem)] leading-[.88] tracking-[-.055em] max-bp3:text-[clamp(2.75rem,14.2vw,5.4rem)]">
        <span class="ln"><span>One platform.</span></span>
        <span class="ln"><span>Complete</span></span>
        <span class="ln"><span>infrastructure</span></span>
        <span class="ln end"><span><span class="grad-t">control.</span></span></span>
      </h1>
    </div>
    <div class="rgrid items-end gap-y-7 mt-[clamp(28px,4vw,52px)] pb-[clamp(36px,5vw,64px)]">
      <p class="col-span-5 max-bp2:col-span-12 max-w-[520px] text-[clamp(17px,1.35vw,20px)] leading-[1.5] text-ink-2"><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">N-Ops</strong> is the open-source control plane for your Linux servers, secrets, containers and jobs. Your whole team works from one place, without expensive proprietary platforms.</p>
      <div class="col-span-6 col-start-7 max-bp2:col-span-12 max-bp2:col-start-1 flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
          <a class="btn btn-dark max-bp4:grow max-bp4:basis-full max-bp4:justify-center" href="https://github.com/Neko-Nik-Org/N-Ops-Main-API" rel="noopener"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-gh"/></svg>Star on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-line max-bp4:grow max-bp4:basis-full max-bp4:justify-center" href="/pricing">See managed service</a>
          <a class="btn btn-line max-bp4:grow max-bp4:basis-full max-bp4:justify-center" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ljCA4-unSYY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the demo</a>
        </div>
        <p class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-[15px] text-mute"><span class="bar"></span>Free to self-host under GNU GPL-V3.0, or run by us with enterprise SLAs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative border-t border-line bg-surface/55 backdrop-blur-[2px]">
    <div class="wrap"><ul class="grid grid-cols-5 max-bp2:grid-cols-1">
      <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-l border-line pt-5 pb-[22px] pl-[18px] text-[15px] text-ink-2 first:border-l-0 first:pl-0 max-bp3:pt-4 max-bp3:pb-4 max-bp3:text-[13.5px]"><span class="bar"></span><span><b class="font-semibold text-ink">GNU GPL-V3.0</b> open source</span></li>
      <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-l border-line pt-5 pb-[22px] pl-[18px] text-[15px] text-ink-2 max-bp2:border-l-0 max-bp2:pl-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp3:pt-4 max-bp3:pb-4 max-bp3:text-[13.5px]"><span class="bar"></span><span><b class="font-semibold text-ink">Self-host</b> or managed</span></li>
      <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-l border-line pt-5 pb-[22px] pl-[18px] text-[15px] text-ink-2 max-bp2:border-l-0 max-bp2:pl-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp3:pt-4 max-bp3:pb-4 max-bp3:text-[13.5px]"><span class="bar"></span><span><b class="font-semibold text-ink">Docker</b> &amp; Podman</span></li>
      <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-l border-line pt-5 pb-[22px] pl-[18px] text-[15px] text-ink-2 max-bp2:border-l-0 max-bp2:pl-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp3:pt-4 max-bp3:pb-4 max-bp3:text-[13.5px]"><span class="bar"></span><span><b class="font-semibold text-ink">No</b> feature walls</span></li>
      <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3 border-l border-line pt-5 pb-[22px] pl-[18px] text-[15px] text-ink-2 max-bp2:border-l-0 max-bp2:pl-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp3:pt-4 max-bp3:pb-4 max-bp3:text-[13.5px]"><span class="bar"></span><span><b class="font-semibold text-ink">No</b> vendor lock</span></li>
    </ul></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ───────── 01 IN PLAIN WORDS ───────── -->
<section class="sec" id="plain" aria-labelledby="p-h">
  <div class="wrap rgrid">
    <p class="eyebrow col-span-12 mb-7"><span class="bar"></span>01 · In plain words</p>
    <h2 class="col-span-12 mb-[clamp(32px,4vw,56px)] font-bold text-[clamp(2.9rem,8.4vw,8.2rem)] leading-[.88] tracking-[-.055em]" id="p-h">Every server, secret and job.<span class="l2 grad-t block">One place to run them.</span></h2>
    <p class="col-span-7 col-start-3 mb-[clamp(48px,6vw,88px)] max-w-[58ch] text-[clamp(18px,1.5vw,22px)] leading-[1.5] text-ink-2">You set up N-Ops once, or we host it for you. Then you add a small agent to each Linux server. From there, your team does the daily work in the browser: <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">secrets, containers, scripts, alerts</strong>. Every action is checked against your rules and written down.</p>
    <div class="parts col-span-12 grid grid-cols-3 max-bp2:grid-cols-1 border-t-[1.5px] border-ink border-b border-line">
      <article class="part flex flex-col gap-4 relative border-r border-line py-[30px] pr-0 pb-9 pl-[var(--gut)] first:pl-0 last:border-r-0 max-bp2:border-r-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp2:first:border-t-0 max-bp2:border-line max-bp2:py-[26px] max-bp2:pb-[30px] max-bp2:px-0">
        <svg class="pin w-11 h-11" viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true"><path class="base" d="M14 46 L14 14 L46 46 L46 14"/><circle cx="14" cy="46" r="5.5"/><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="5.5"/><circle cx="46" cy="46" r="5.5"/><circle cx="46" cy="14" r="5.5"/><circle class="mid" cx="30" cy="30" r="6"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.6rem)] tracking-[-.045em] leading-none">The control plane</h3>
        <p class="max-w-[38ch] text-[16.5px] text-ink-2">The N-Ops server. It holds your inventory, rules, secrets, job queues and audit log, and decides what is allowed to happen. Run it on your own server, or let us run it.</p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.12em] uppercase text-mute">Runs on your servers or ours</p>
        <ul class="grid gap-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Decides who can do what: roles, multi-factor sign-in, approvals</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Keeps secrets encrypted with AES-256-GCM, with version history</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Queues work for each server and keeps it through outages</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Records every action in a searchable audit log</span></li></ul>
        <p class="like mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-dashed border-line-2 pt-[18px] text-base text-ink"><span class="bar"></span><span>Like an air-traffic control tower: it doesn't fly the planes, but nothing takes off without it.</span></p>
      </article>
      <article class="part flex flex-col gap-4 relative border-r border-line py-[30px] pr-0 pb-9 pl-[var(--gut)] first:pl-0 last:border-r-0 max-bp2:border-r-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp2:first:border-t-0 max-bp2:border-line max-bp2:py-[26px] max-bp2:pb-[30px] max-bp2:px-0">
        <svg class="pin w-11 h-11" viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true"><path class="base" d="M14 46 L14 14 L46 46 L46 14"/><circle cx="14" cy="46" r="5.5"/><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="5.5"/><circle cx="46" cy="46" r="5.5" class="on"/><circle cx="46" cy="14" r="5.5"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.6rem)] tracking-[-.045em] leading-none">The agent</h3>
        <p class="max-w-[38ch] text-[16.5px] text-ink-2">A small program on each Linux server. It connects the machine to the control plane, reports how it's doing, and carries out the jobs your team approves.</p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.12em] uppercase text-mute">Runs on each Linux server</p>
        <ul class="grid gap-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Reports OS, kernel, architecture and live metrics</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Runs approved commands, scripts and Ansible playbooks</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Manages Docker, Podman, Compose and system services</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Reconnects on its own after a dropped connection</span></li></ul>
        <p class="like mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-dashed border-line-2 pt-[18px] text-base text-ink"><span class="bar"></span><span>Like a trusted pair of hands on every machine, so nobody has to log in to each one.</span></p>
      </article>
      <article class="part flex flex-col gap-4 relative border-r border-line py-[30px] pr-0 pb-9 pl-[var(--gut)] first:pl-0 last:border-r-0 max-bp2:border-r-0 max-bp2:border-t max-bp2:first:border-t-0 max-bp2:border-line max-bp2:py-[26px] max-bp2:pb-[30px] max-bp2:px-0">
        <svg class="pin w-11 h-11" viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true"><path class="base" d="M14 46 L14 14 L46 46 L46 14"/><circle cx="14" cy="46" r="5.5" class="on"/><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="5.5"/><circle cx="46" cy="46" r="5.5"/><circle cx="46" cy="14" r="5.5"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.6rem)] tracking-[-.045em] leading-none">The web app</h3>
        <p class="max-w-[38ch] text-[16.5px] text-ink-2">Where your team works. Servers, secrets, containers, jobs, a terminal and the audit log, all in one browser tab, with each person seeing only what they're allowed to.</p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.12em] uppercase text-mute">Used by your whole team</p>
        <ul class="grid gap-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Servers and their health, live</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Secrets, configuration and read-only API keys</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>Browser terminal and file manager</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span>The audit log, filtered to what each person may see</span></li></ul>
        <p class="like mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-dashed border-line-2 pt-[18px] text-base text-ink"><span class="bar"></span><span>Like one shared screen for the whole team, with the right doors locked for each person.</span></p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="plain-foot col-span-12 mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-10 gap-y-4">
      <p class="font-semibold tracking-[-.03em] leading-[1.2] max-w-[40ch] text-[clamp(1.2rem,1.8vw,1.6rem)]">Every request goes from the web app, through the control plane, to an agent, and back.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-line sm" href="#architecture">Follow a request</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ───────── 02 CAPABILITIES ───────── -->
<section class="sec alt" id="chapters" aria-labelledby="c-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="rgrid sh">
      <div class="sh-num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
      <div class="sh-main">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>What N-Ops covers</p>
        <h2 id="c-h">Nine modules. <span class="grad-t">One control plane.</span></h2>
        <p class="sub">The everyday work of running infrastructure, under one roof. Each module builds on the one before it, until the N is complete.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="rgrid">
      <ol class="caps col-span-12 border-t-[1.5px] border-ink">
        {areas.map(a => (
<li class="cap group relative grid grid-cols-[3.2rem_minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,6fr)_60px] max-bp3:grid-cols-[2.2rem_minmax(0,1fr)_44px] gap-x-[var(--gut)] gap-y-[var(--gut)] max-bp3:gap-y-[10px] items-center py-[clamp(24px,2.8vw,36px)] border-b border-line after:content-[''] after:absolute after:left-0 after:right-0 after:-bottom-px after:h-0.5 after:[background:var(--grad)] after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:transition-transform after:duration-[600ms] after:ease-std hover:after:scale-x-100"><span class="n font-mono text-xs leading-none text-mute tracking-[.06em]">{a.n}</span><h3 class="font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] leading-[1.02] text-[clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2.6rem)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-std group-hover:translate-x-[10px]">{a.title}</h3><div class="cd max-bp3:col-start-2 max-bp3:col-span-2 max-bp3:row-start-2"><p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.5] max-w-[52ch] text-[clamp(16px,1.2vw,18px)]">{a.lead}</p><ul class="tags flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-3.5">{a.tags.map(tg => <li class="font-mono text-xs leading-none text-ink-2 border border-line-2 rounded-md px-2.5 py-[7px] bg-surface">{tg}</li>)}</ul></div>
          <a href={`/product/${a.slug}`} aria-label={`Read more: ${a.title}`} class="justify-self-end grid place-items-center w-[60px] h-[60px] max-bp3:w-11 max-bp3:h-11 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-line-2 text-ink transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-mint hover:border-mint hover:text-ink-f group-hover:border-ink after:content-[''] after:absolute after:inset-0"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <div class="caps-foot col-span-12 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3.5 justify-between items-center">
        <p class="note text-[15px] text-mute flex gap-2.5 items-baseline"><span class="bar"></span>N-Ops is in active development, and the list keeps growing.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-line sm" href="https://github.com/Neko-Nik-Org/N-Ops-Main-API" rel="noopener">Follow along on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ───────── 03 ARCHITECTURE ───────── -->
<section class="sec" id="architecture" aria-labelledby="a-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="rgrid sh">
      <div class="sh-num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
      <div class="sh-main">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>Architecture</p>
        <h2 id="a-h">Five points. <span class="grad-t">One control plane.</span></h2>
        <p class="sub">The control plane decides and keeps track. The agents on your servers do the work. Every request takes the same five steps between them, from the first click to the audit log.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="arch"><div class="arch-row grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[var(--gut)] gap-y-8 items-center py-[clamp(32px,4.5vw,64px)]"><div class="col-span-5 max-bp2:col-span-12 col-start-1 max-bp2:col-start-1 max-bp2:order-1"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-mint-ink">01 · Step 1</p><h3 class="mt-4 mb-4 text-[clamp(1.9rem,3vw,2.8rem)] leading-[1.05] font-semibold tracking-[-.04em]">You ask</h3><p class="text-mute text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">Someone on your team opens N-Ops in the browser and asks for something: restart a container, run a script on twenty servers, or reveal a database password.</p><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Web app</b> <span class="text-mute">· servers, secrets, jobs</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Browser terminal</b> <span class="text-mute">· a shell in the browser</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">File manager</b> <span class="text-mute">· files on any server</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" 