acking-[-.04em]">Your server does it</h3><p class="text-mute text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">The agent on each Linux server picks up its next job and runs it: a command, a script, an Ansible playbook, or a change to Docker, Podman, Compose or a system service.</p><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Server reports</b> <span class="text-mute">· OS, kernel, arch, metrics</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Containers</b> <span class="text-mute">· Docker, Podman, Compose</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">System services</b> <span class="text-mute">· start, stop, status</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Reconnects</b> <span class="text-mute">· on its own after a drop</span></span></li></ul></div></div><div class="arch-row grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-[var(--gut)] gap-y-8 items-center py-[clamp(32px,4.5vw,64px)]"><div class="col-span-5 max-bp2:col-span-12 col-start-1 max-bp2:col-start-1 max-bp2:order-1"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-mint-ink">05 · Step 5</p><h3 class="mt-4 mb-4 text-[clamp(1.9rem,3vw,2.8rem)] leading-[1.05] font-semibold tracking-[-.04em]">Everything is recorded</h3><p class="text-mute text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">The result comes back to your screen, and every step lands in a searchable audit log with sensitive values redacted. If a server goes quiet, N-Ops emails you.</p><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Audit log</b> <span class="text-mute">· who, what, when</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Redaction</b> <span class="text-mute">· secrets stay out of logs</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Offline alerts</b> <span class="text-mute">· by email</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.45]"><svg class="mt-[5px] shrink-0 text-mint-ink" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5"/></svg><span><b class="font-medium">Log downloads</b> <span class="text-mute">· download in the app, or emailed on a schedule</span></span></li></ul></div><div class="col-span-6 max-bp2:col-span-12 col-start-7 max-bp2:col-start-1 max-bp2:order-2"><div class="arch-card rounded-[clamp(18px,2vw,26px)] border border-[var(--color-line-2)] bg-bg-2 p-[clamp(10px,1.4vw,16px)]" role="img" aria-label="A searchable audit log with secret values redacted and an offline alert email"><div class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-line-2)] bg-surface overflow-hidden font-mono text-[10.5px] leading-[1.4] text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-2.5 border-b border-[var(--color-line-2)] text-mute"><span class="flex gap-1"><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-2"></i><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-2"></i><i class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-2"></i></span><span>Audit log</span><span class="ml-auto">search</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-3.5 py-2.5 border-t border-[var(--color-line-2)]"><span class="text-mute">10:42</span><span class="flex-1 truncate">priya · run deploy.sh</span><span class="px-1.5 py-[3px] rounded border text-[9.5px] leading-none whitespace-nowrap text-mint-ink bg-[rgba(76,242,192,.12)] border-[rgba(76,242,192,.25)]">ok</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-3.5 py-2.5 border-t border-[var(--color-line-2)]"><span class="text-mute">10:42</span><span class="flex-1 truncate">agent web-01 · job #4821</span><span class="px-1.5 py-[3px] rounded border text-[9.5px] leading-none whitespace-nowrap text-mint-ink bg-[rgba(76,242,192,.12)] border-[rgba(76,242,192,.25)]">ok</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-3.5 py-2.5 border-t border-[var(--color-line-2)]"><span class="text-mute">10:39</span><span class="flex-1 truncate">arjun · reveal DATABASE_URL=••••••</span><span class="px-1.5 py-[3px] rounded border text-[9.5px] leading-none whitespace-nowrap text-violet-ink bg-[rgba(138,124,255,.12)] border-[rgba(138,124,255,.28)]">logged</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-3.5 py-2.5 border-t border-[var(--color-line-2)] bg-[rgba(245,184,74,.06)]"><span class="text-amber flex-1">mail-01 went quiet · email sent</span><span class="px-1.5 py-[3px] rounded border text-[9.5px] leading-none whitespace-nowrap text-amber bg-[rgba(245,184,74,.1)] border-[rgba(245,184,74,.28)]">alert</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ───────── 04 SECURITY ───────── -->
<section class="sec alt" id="security" aria-labelledby="s-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="rgrid sh">
      <div class="sh-num" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
      <div class="sh-main">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="bar"></span>Security</p>
        <h2 id="s-h">Locked down. <span class="grad-t">Easy to check.</span></h2>
        <p class="sub">Security in N-Ops comes down to four plain questions: who gets in, what they can do, what stays secret, and what gets written down. Here is how each one is answered.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="rgrid">
      <div class="guard on-dark col-span-12 rounded-[clamp(20px,2.2vw,30px)] bg-t-bg text-t-ink p-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,56px)] grid grid-cols-4 max-bp1:grid-cols-2 max-bp3:grid-cols-1 max-bp3:p-6 max-bp3:px-5 gap-x-[var(--gut)] gap-y-[clamp(24px,2.6vw,40px)]">
        <div class="sg border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)] pt-[22px]">
          <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(1.4rem,2vw,1.9rem)]">Who gets in</h3>
          <a class="at inline-flex gap-2 items-center mt-3 font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-none tracking-[.06em] text-t-mute transition-colors hover:text-mint before:content-[''] before:w-[9px] before:h-[3px] before:bg-mint" href="#architecture" data-step="1">Checked at step 2</a>
          <ul class="mt-[22px]">
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Multi-factor sign-in</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">A code from an authenticator app (TOTP), a security key (WebAuthn, FIDO2) or an email code, on top of the password.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">IP range allowlists</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Sign-ins only from addresses you trust, like your office or VPN.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Geo-restrictions</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Block sign-ins from countries where your team doesn't work.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="sg border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)] pt-[22px]">
          <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(1.4rem,2vw,1.9rem)]">What they can do</h3>
          <a class="at inline-flex gap-2 items-center mt-3 font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-none tracking-[.06em] text-t-mute transition-colors hover:text-mint before:content-[''] before:w-[9px] before:h-[3px] before:bg-mint" href="#architecture" data-step="1">Checked at step 2</a>
          <ul class="mt-[22px]">
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Roles and permissions</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Each person gets the access their job needs, and nothing more.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Approval workflows</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Sensitive commands wait until an admin approves them.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Read-only API keys</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Apps fetch only the secrets they're scoped to, and can't change anything.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="sg border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)] pt-[22px]">
          <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(1.4rem,2vw,1.9rem)]">What stays secret</h3>
          <a class="at inline-flex gap-2 items-center mt-3 font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-none tracking-[.06em] text-t-mute transition-colors hover:text-mint before:content-[''] before:w-[9px] before:h-[3px] before:bg-mint" href="#architecture" data-step="2">Kept at step 3</a>
          <ul class="mt-[22px]">
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">AES-256-GCM encryption</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Secrets are stored encrypted, with a cipher widely used to protect HTTPS traffic.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Tag-based reveal</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">People see only the secrets their tags allow.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Versions</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Every change is kept, so you can see what a value was and who changed it.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="sg border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)] pt-[22px]">
          <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(1.4rem,2vw,1.9rem)]">What gets written down</h3>
          <a class="at inline-flex gap-2 items-center mt-3 font-mono text-[11.5px] leading-none tracking-[.06em] text-t-mute transition-colors hover:text-mint before:content-[''] before:w-[9px] before:h-[3px] before:bg-mint" href="#architecture" data-step="4">Recorded at step 5</a>
          <ul class="mt-[22px]">
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Audit log</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Sign-ins, reveals, commands and changes, all searchable.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Redaction</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Sensitive values are masked in logs and output.</span></li>
            <li class="py-4 border-t border-[var(--color-t-line)]"><b class="block font-semibold text-[16.5px] tracking-[-.01em]">Logs delivered your way</b><span class="block mt-1.5 text-[#AEB9C6] text-[15px] leading-[1.5]">Download logs from the web app, or let a workflow email them to your team on a schedule.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

